Subject: [PATCH 11/14] Titan 2: rear screen power group timeout

The rear screen group sleeps after titan2_rear_screen_off_timeout (default 30 s, no dimming).
The group is found lazily (its display is not in it yet when the group is added) and forgotten
when the group is removed. "Stay awake while charging" keeps only the main screen on: the rear
AMOLED faces up on the table, and its touch only reports the double tap while it sleeps.
